                p.fw-normal.text-secondary The Terms relate to the use of the Site and materials contained herein as well as any electronic communications sent in connection with your use of the Site, such as (but not limited to) confirmation emails, follow-up emails, and email newsletters.
                p.fw-normal.text-secondary The Terms may be modified or revised at any time without notice. By using the Site, you are agreeing to be bound by the current version of the Terms and the Terms will constitute a legal agreement between you and the QFCA. If you do not agree with any of the Terms or any change to the Terms, or cannot comply with the Terms , then please refrain from using the Site.
